<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Randstad 1996 net profit NLG 207 mln.</title>
<headline>Randstad 1996 net profit NLG 207 mln.</headline>
<text>
<p>Interest gains			 5.7  vs   5.6</p>
<p>    Tax				    113.6  vs  92.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Temporary labour group Randstad Holding NV said in January it expected 1996 profit to have risen by about 25 pct.</p>
